<div class="landing-hero">
  <div class="landing-pitch">
    <span class="tiny-label ochre-label">Issue №01 · A directory</span>
    <h1 class="hero-headline">
      The book<br/>
      you want,<br/>
      <em class="ochre-italic">somewhere</em><br/>
      close by.
    </h1>
    <p class="hero-body">
      Bookpile takes an ISBN and tells you which bookshops, chains and
      libraries near you have it. No affiliate links. No price-tracking
      cookies. Just a list of places to walk into.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="landing-form-col">
    <div class="form-card">
      <span class="tiny-label">Find a book</span>
      <form action="/" method="post" id="isbn-form" style="margin-top:14px">
        <input type="hidden" name="_csrf_token" value={get_csrf_token()} />
        <label class="isbn-label">Enter an ISBN</label>
        <div class="input-row">
          <input
            type="text"
            name="isbn"
            id="isbn-input"
            class="isbn-input"
            placeholder="978-…"
            autocomplete="off"
          />
          <button type="submit" class="pile-btn">PILE IT ↗</button>
        </div>
        <div class="demo-row">
          <span class="demo-label">Or peek at the demo</span>
          <a href={~p"/b/9781529340594"} class="demo-link">Intermezzo →</a>
        </div>
      </form>
    </div>

    <div class="info-grid">
      <span class="info-num">01</span>
      <span>Detected in <strong class="city-strong">{@city}, {@country}</strong> — change on the next page.</span>
      <span class="info-num">02</span>
      <span>{@stats.countries} countries · {@stats.cities} cities · {@stats.shops} places currently stocked.</span>
      <span class="info-num">03</span>
      <span>We never see what you searched.</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
